#!name=👑 Nguyễn Ngọc Anh Tú 🌸 ⁕ Ultimate Premium & Best AdBlock ⁕
#!desc=🚀 Mở khóa 350+ App VIP (Locket Gold, Spotify, YouTube Premium, Captions AI, iScreen, MD Vinyl, Moises, Structured, iTunes 250+, SoundCloud, WPS, Darkroom, OldRoll, Fimo, Calm, Remini, PhotoRoom, ELSA...). 🛡️ Chặn Quảng Cáo 100% (AdGuard DoH, Rule-Sets Ads/Tracking/Malware/HostsVN/QC App VN). 🎮 Gaming DIRECT (PUBG, Liên Quân, Genshin...). 📺 Streaming PROXY (Netflix, Disney+, HBO...). ⚡ Tối ưu DNS, Banking VN, GeoIP VN, Chặn iOS OTA & App Store Ads.
#!version=2.8.3-stable
#!date=2026-10-06
#!author=Nguyễn Ngọc Anh Tú (z3rokaze)
#!homepage=https://github.com/ekaznyra/NguyenNgocAnhTu
